WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.600
we simply decided that
we were going to call it Apple Computer

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.540
unless some suggested a better
name by five o'clock that day

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.480
and partially

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.820
because

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.260
I like apples a lot...

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.280
and partially

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.980
because Apple is ahead of Atari in the 
phone book

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.920
But, we re examined it

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.300
on a regular basis

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.760
and we found the juxtaposition of something

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.520
that seemed to epitomize what we were going after

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.600
which was simplicty, and yet

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.180
very refined sophistication.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.320
and, in our first brochure, probably some of you had it, had the...

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.720
the title of it was "Simplicity is the ultimate 
sophistication."

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.560
and that wasn't just a

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.580
bullshit slogan, it actually was 
really what

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.980
we've been striving for

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:54.660
and the...

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.800
apple seemed to symbolize that.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:58.420
So,

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.800
I think we are going to stich with it.

